{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088574","type":"dois","attributes":{"doi":"10.5281/zenodo.24088574","prefix":"10.5281","suffix":"zenodo.24088574","identifiers":[{"identifier":"oai:zenodo.org:24088574","identifierType":"oai"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"alternateIdentifierType":"oai","alternateIdentifier":"oai:zenodo.org:24088574"}],"creators":[{"name":"Vale, Dorian","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Dorian","familyName":"Vale","affiliation":["Museum of One"],"nameIdentifiers":[{"nameIdentifier":"0009-0004-7737-5094","nameIdentifierScheme":"ORCID"}]}],"titles":[{"title":"Documentary Evidence and Source Comparisons: Supplement 1 to Relational Archival Investigation"}],"publisher":"Museum of One","container":{},"publicationYear":2026,"subjects":[{"subject":"Relational Archival Investigation"},{"subject":"Korean experimental art"},{"subject":"documentary evidence"},{"subject":"source criticism"},{"subject":"museum acquisition records"},{"subject":"collection cataloguing"},{"subject":"historical chronology"},{"subject":"Lee Kang-so"},{"subject":"Jeok–Eungnyeok"},{"subject":"Korean art"},{"subject":"Korean art history"},{"subject":"Art archives"},{"subject":"Museum collection cataloguing"},{"subject":"Artwork dating"},{"subject":"1975 Paris Biennale"},{"subject":"한국미술"},{"subject":"한국미술사"},{"subject":"한국 실험미술"},{"subject":"미술 아카이브"},{"subject":"국립현대미술관"},{"subject":"서울시립 미술아카이브"},{"subject":"이강소"},{"subject":"Park Suk-won"},{"subject":"박석원"},{"subject":"Sung Neung Kyung"},{"subject":"성능경"},{"subject":"Kim Youngjin"},{"subject":"김영진"},{"subject":"Kim Yong-Ik"},{"subject":"김용익"},{"subject":"Rim Dong Sik"},{"subject":"임동식"},{"subject":"Post-Interpretive Criticism"},{"subject":"Museum of One"},{"subject":"Dorian Vale"}],"contributors":[],"dates":[{"date":"2026-11-09","dateType":"Issued"}],"language":"en","types":{"ris":"RPRT","bibtex":"article","citeproc":"article-journal","schemaOrg":"ScholarlyArticle","resourceType":"Technical note","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text"},"relatedIdentifiers":[{"relationType":"IsSupplementTo","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.24088563","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"IsDescribedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://www.museumofone.art/rai-documentary-supplement/","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsDescribedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://hal.science/hal-05858137","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsCitedBy","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.24095953","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"IsCitedBy","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.24095308","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"IsIdenticalTo","relatedIdentifier":"https://osf.io/zhnre/files/b86dp","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsDescribedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://philarchive.org/rec/VALDEA-4","resourceTypeGeneral":"Other","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsDescribedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://archive.museumofone.art/items/24088574.html","resourceTypeGeneral":"Other","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsReferencedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://www.museumofone.art/relational-archival-investigation/","resourceTypeGeneral":"Other","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsVersionOf","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.24088572","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"}],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":[],"version":"1.0","rightsList":[{"rights":"In Copyright"},{"rights":"© 2026 Dorian Vale · Museum of One","rightsUri":"http://rightsstatements.org/vocab/InC/1.0/"}],"descriptions":[{"description":"The documentary supplement makes the evidence behind Relational Archival Investigation traceable for Korean art history and art archive research. It pairs acquisition entries 73–79 on printed pages 39–40 of the National Museum of Modern and Contemporary Art, Korea (MMCA), 2016 Annual Report with collection records 7922–7928, management numbers 07909–07915. It records agreements, discrepancies and unresolved comparisons. It documents Lee Kang-so’s Untitled 75031 and its 1975 Paris Biennale chronology, Park Suk-won’s Jeok–Eungnyeok, Sung Neung Kyung’s newspaper works and Kim Youngjin’s video and installation records. Additional sections identify Seoul Museum of Art Archives records for Kim Yong-Ik and Rim Dong Sik. Record IDs, selected excerpts, paraphrases and attribution make the judgments auditable. The seven-entry block was selected retrospectively and is a bounded comparison.\n\n한국어 초록한국 실험미술의 사료 대조를 위한 자료편이다. 국립현대미술관의 2016년 연보 수집 목록 73–79번과 소장품 기록 7922–7928(관리번호 07909–07915)을 항목별로 대조한다. 이강소의 〈무제 75031〉과 파리비엔날레, 박석원의 〈적-응력〉, 성능경의 신문 작업, 김영진의 비디오 설치를 다룬다. 서울시립 미술아카이브의 김용익·임동식 자료도 기록 번호와 출처를 밝혀 제시한다.\n\nArtists in this studyLee Kang-so (이강소; Lee Kangso, Lee Kang So) · Park Suk-won (박석원; Park Suk Won) · Sung Neung Kyung (성능경; Sung Neungkyung) · Kim Youngjin (김영진; KIM Youngjin b, 김영진 b) · Kim Yong-Ik (김용익; Kim Yong Ik) · Rim Dong Sik (임동식; Rim Dongsik)\n\nWorks discussedUntitled 75031 (무제 75031) · Painting (Event 77–2) (페인팅 (이벤트 77-2)) · Painting–78–1 (페인팅-78-1) · Jeok–Eungnyeok (적-응력) · Eight Pages of Newspaper (8면의 신문) · Reading Newspaper (신문 읽기) · 1978–10–2 · 1978–2 · Flat Object (평면 오브제) · Tying Reeds and Beard (갈대와 수염 묶기)\n\nDorian Vale, Museum of One, 2026. ORCID 0009-0004-7737-5094. Version 1.0. © 2026 Dorian Vale · Museum of One.\n\nAuthor and publisher authority recordsDorian Vale | ORCID 0009-0004-7737-5094 | Wikidata Q136308916 | ISNI 0000000528819744 (publisher-attested)Museum of One | Wikidata Q136308879 | ISNI 0000000528819728 (publisher-attested)\n\nResearch context and responsibility. This methodological supplement belongs to the Relational Archival Investigation research programme; Post-Interpretive Criticism provides the philosophical background to the main study. Dorian Vale is the sole author, affiliated with Museum of One, which is also the publisher. MMCA, SeMA and other museums or archives examined are research subjects and documentary sources, not author affiliations or funders. This is a technical note accompanying the separately identified main working paper, not a new version of that paper.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24088574","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":3,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"api","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":0,"citationCount":7,"citationsOverTime":[{"year":"2026","total":7}],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":1,"created":"2026-11-09T16:22:56.000Z","registered":"2026-11-09T16:22:56.000Z","published":"2026","updated":"2026-11-11T14:02:51.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"cern.zenodo","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"cern","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088574","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[]},"citations":{"data":[{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088562","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088563","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24095953","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24095308","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24093528","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24095952","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24093529","type":"dois"}]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[]},"versions":{"data":[]},"versionOf":{"data":[{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088572","type":"dois"}]}}}}